1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,717
ided by holy

2
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:10,040
Thank you.

3
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:37,840
All of the air, it seems to
be flowing over to Wamuu.

4
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:44,440
My ultimate mastery, atmospheric rift!

5
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,760
That's only wind!

6
00:01:53,220 --> 00:01:55,040
I know you're near the flame.

7
00:01:55,440 --> 00:01:59,000
I sense it, though I can't
see exactly where that is.

8
00:01:59,160 --> 00:02:01,560
But I am going to find you eventually.

9
00:02:01,960 --> 00:02:05,557
Now that I've prevented you from
gathering your Hormone energy,

10
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,346
I'm going to cut you in half!

11
00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:12,320
Atmospheric Rift is Wamuu's
supreme final weapon.

12
00:02:12,740 --> 00:02:16,057
The pipes he uses to
cloak himself take in huge

13
00:02:16,140 --> 00:02:19,680
amounts of air and then
unbelievably compress it.

14
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:23,797
The air is then blasted from
an orifice thinner than paper.

15
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:26,060
It is a razor made of wind.

16
00:02:26,740 --> 00:02:32,100
But it creates heat and friction
at levels terrible even for Wamuu.

17
00:02:32,580 --> 00:02:34,520
His body cannot handle it.

18
00:02:34,700 --> 00:02:36,280
He is falling apart.

19
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:40,720
But he is certainly a breathtaking
figure, tragic and heroic.

20
00:02:41,540 --> 00:02:43,420
Victory is yours, Wamuu.

21
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:47,120
Take his life as a bomb
for your wound. Shoujo!

22
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,600
It's getting close!

23
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:52,527
Time to pull off one of
my famous tricks now!

24
00:02:52,700 --> 00:02:55,480
This one's called the Harmon Oil Trick!

25
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:59,560
His lungs are literally
high-pressure oxygen tanks!

26
00:03:00,460 --> 00:03:05,317
Those pipes, if I can only hit
them, he'd inhale the flaming oil?

27
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:08,282
which in turn would create
an internal explosion!

28
00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:11,420
But this is the very
last ace up my sleeve!

29
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,480
If I mess it up...

30
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:15,777
Got you now!

31
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:18,540
Your life is mine damn it.

32
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,237
That's your choice fool!

33
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:33,600
I can sense anything that is
far enough away from the fire.

34
00:03:34,340 --> 00:03:39,380
You're out of tricks and that cry
of yours gave away your position.

35
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,380
Atmospheric rift.

36
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:46,830
SIR!

37
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,760
Lend me your strays!

38
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:52,580
Another fire attack!

39
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:55,500
I told you I can sense these things.

40
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:02,380
And now I will cut you in
half to claim my victory!

41
00:04:03,260 --> 00:04:04,200
Jojo, no!

42
00:04:04,380 --> 00:04:06,100
Now he has finally won.

43
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:12,240
Wamu, let me tell you
exactly when you lost.

44
00:04:12,460 --> 00:04:15,220
It was when I threw Caesar's scarf. Huh?

45
00:04:15,860 --> 00:04:16,980
Don't you get it?

46
00:04:17,100 --> 00:04:20,317
I meant for you to cut the
bottle in half the entire time.

47
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:25,140
Your ability to do it so quickly and
easily is what led to your downfall.

48
00:04:26,380 --> 00:04:29,240
The oil inside of it is now vaporizing.

49
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,620
And look, you see the bandana?

50
00:04:31,820 --> 00:04:33,560
All the pieces flying around?

51
00:04:33,860 --> 00:04:38,540
Every little fragment is still on
fire, and they're entering my body.

52
00:04:40,160 --> 00:04:43,780
Wamuu, you have been a
worthy and admirable fighter.

53
00:04:44,540 --> 00:04:49,680
But a powerful ally named Caesar
was with me throughout this contest.

54
00:04:58,940 --> 00:05:00,560
He was defeated.

55
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:03,360
Lord Wamuu, how could he have lost?

56
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:20,160
Jojo, be careful, he can regenerate,
even like that after being blown to bits.

57
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:24,264
You have to use your strongest
hormone to destroy him completely.

58
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:33,120
So it is finally over now, Jojo.

59
00:05:36,180 --> 00:05:37,120
It is.

60
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:40,100
You took revenge for Caesar.

61
00:05:40,580 --> 00:05:41,920
Yes, I did.

62
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,920
Then go ahead.

63
00:05:44,380 --> 00:05:45,520
Finish it.

64
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,320
I will!

65
00:05:52,380 --> 00:05:53,360
Oh.

66
00:06:01,860 --> 00:06:03,840
What is going on?

67
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:07,020
That smoke isn't from the flaming oil.

68
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,960
It's coming from your wounds.

69
00:06:10,260 --> 00:06:12,957
The hormone from your
arms spread through you.

70
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:15,040
Every part of you is infected now.

71
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:16,358
You are dissolving.

72
00:06:16,620 --> 00:06:18,920
I can only imagine the agony you feel.

73
00:06:19,540 --> 00:06:21,760
I can't prevent you from dying now.

74
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:22,940
But there's this.

75
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:25,236
My blood can at least ease your pain.

76
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,500
Why do you want to shame me?

77
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:30,480
I have made peace with myself. Stop!

78
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:32,500
I don't need pity from you!

79
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,697
Is that what you think?

80
00:06:34,780 --> 00:06:37,720
That this is done out of pity for you? No.

81
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:42,437
Why didn't you destroy Caesar's bubble of
blood that carried his bandana and ring,

82
00:06:42,520 --> 00:06:45,517
knowing full well that they
posed a serious threat to you?

83
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,860
Was that pity?

84
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:51,837
It was because the man was
a worthy and noble warrior.

85
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:54,380
He deserved to be honored for that.

86
00:06:55,160 --> 00:06:58,237
What you'll say next is,
Jojo, you can't mean...

87
00:06:58,320 --> 00:07:00,837
Jojo, you can't mean...

88
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,300
Yes, I do, Wamu.

89
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:07,545
The honor you showed my friend, Caesar's
warrior spirit, had earned your respect.

90
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:12,820
So in return, I wanted to find a
way to honor your warrior spirit.

91
00:07:13,260 --> 00:07:15,640
My blood is a tribute to you.

92
00:07:19,400 --> 00:07:20,920
You beat me, Jojo.

93
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:26,020
And as a warrior, it would now appear
that you stand taller than I do.

94
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,000
EA, kill the bastard!

95
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:36,250
Hold!

96
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:38,600
What betrayal is this?

97
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,750
Huh?

98
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,560
You cowardly animals!

99
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:51,750
Wamuu!

100
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,750
Why do that?

101
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:55,820
I am Wamuu.

102
00:07:56,600 --> 00:08:01,100
Although sworn to Lord Kars, I will
not allow the vampires to attack you.

103
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,380
It's not because of sentiment.

104
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:05,960
I told Caesar this as well.

105
00:08:06,920 --> 00:08:09,500
To me, only the strong truly existed.

106
00:08:10,300 --> 00:08:13,060
Victory was the single
quality to be admired.

107
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:17,460
I existed only according
to my own code of honor.

108
00:08:18,800 --> 00:08:20,260
Jojo, please understand.

109
00:08:20,660 --> 00:08:25,420
To me, immortality was something
utterly unimportant and trivial.

110
00:08:27,080 --> 00:08:31,060
All that has ever mattered to
me was living up to my code.

111
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:37,100
And now, I desire that you
should drink the antidote.

112
00:08:37,480 --> 00:08:40,540
You must do it before I
dissolve completely away.

113
00:08:41,340 --> 00:08:42,752
You won't see it though.

114
00:08:43,020 --> 00:08:45,620
I don't need eyes, words, or a horn.

115
00:08:45,900 --> 00:08:47,100
I will know it.

116
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,320
What matters is that you do it.

117
00:08:57,100 --> 00:08:58,640
I have no regrets.

118
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:03,200
I am glad I was able to witness
your growth as a warrior.

119
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:08,417
Perhaps the reason I
lived these thousands of

120
00:09:08,500 --> 00:09:11,240
years was so that I could
meet you at the end.

121
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:19,120
Farewell to you, Warrior Jojo.

122
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:30,240
Wamu became one with the wind.

123
00:09:31,020 --> 00:09:34,460
Jojo gave his opponent one final salute.

124
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:38,860
Though no tears fell, they
had shared a silent song.

125
00:09:39,460 --> 00:09:42,200
They had shared a warrior's affinity.

126
00:09:49,200 --> 00:09:51,560
Wamu, you must kill him.

127
00:09:52,180 --> 00:09:57,300
But, my lord Kars, with utmost respect,
he is only an innocent young boy.

128
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:59,900
That's true, just a boy.

129
00:10:00,260 --> 00:10:02,440
That is the reason he must die.

130
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:05,480
If these Hormone users
are allowed to live,

131
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:08,097
they're likely to become
our mortal enemies.

132
00:10:08,180 --> 00:10:10,760
And humans grow very quickly indeed.

133
00:10:11,560 --> 00:10:12,390
Hmm.

134
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,580
Is it beyond you?

135
00:10:14,880 --> 00:10:18,060
It would seem I must
demonstrate how it is done.

136
00:10:18,300 --> 00:10:20,617
Now, in resolving the problem...

137
00:10:20,700 --> 00:10:23,120
is handled like this, Wamuu.

138
00:10:26,500 --> 00:10:27,330
Wamuu.

139
00:10:27,540 --> 00:10:30,800
He was too pure in his warrior philosophy.

140
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:33,340
And he became weak as a result.

141
00:10:33,620 --> 00:10:35,480
Well, that's the end of Wamuu.

142
00:10:35,940 --> 00:10:36,880
Indeed it is.

143
00:10:37,060 --> 00:10:39,520
What a disappointment. You're right.

144
00:10:39,760 --> 00:10:41,060
He's only a poser.

145
00:10:41,500 --> 00:10:43,794
Your followers are such base creatures.

146
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:45,333
Makes me want to vomit.

147
00:10:47,620 --> 00:10:48,717
No, don't!

148
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:49,740
Don't curse me!

149
00:10:54,020 --> 00:10:56,580
I alone am the only one to remain,

150
00:10:56,780 --> 00:11:01,677
because this world and

151
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:04,080
all in it belong to me.

152
00:11:09,360 --> 00:11:10,680
Look at him, look!

153
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:12,760
Lord Kars is amazing!

154
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,700
Our lord is ready to fight!

155
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:18,510
Listen,

156
00:11:18,593 --> 00:11:22,757
Lord Kars, there's no reason for you to
waste time on any one-on-one battles.

157
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:23,840
Forget the rules.

158
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,920
Let us kill these two for you.

159
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:29,340
Or you lord will turn
them into spades of blood!

160
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:31,721
Just what I thought you would do.

161
00:11:34,860 --> 00:11:35,980
I told you.

162
00:11:37,560 --> 00:11:39,120
The redstone! Look!

163
00:11:39,320 --> 00:11:41,577
It's me against Kars, one-on-one.

164
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:44,072
But if those terms aren't to your liking,

165
00:11:44,200 --> 00:11:47,057
why don't I just smash this
thing right here and now?

166
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,780
I will honor my word.

167
00:11:49,060 --> 00:11:51,400
A one-on-one fight. Count on it.

168
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,579
My promise stands.

169
00:11:53,160 --> 00:11:56,480
That is why I chose to
reveal my horn to you.

170
00:11:56,720 --> 00:12:02,640
As for my underlings' behavior, as you
can clearly see, they are already dead.

171
00:12:04,080 --> 00:12:05,540
My Lord Coors!

172
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,060
All I want is that red stone.

173
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:15,940
However, though, ACDC and Wamuu
were my comrades for 10,000 years.

174
00:12:16,300 --> 00:12:21,120
I have no choice but to honor both their
warrior deaths and their warrior pride.

175
00:12:21,560 --> 00:12:24,217
I will fight you Hamon users fairly,

176
00:12:24,300 --> 00:12:28,220
and then I will finish
this with my own two hands.

177
00:12:28,700 --> 00:12:30,060
For you, Lisa Lisa,

178
00:12:30,540 --> 00:12:34,537
seeing the fighter you are, I will
not think of you as merely a woman.

179
00:12:34,620 --> 00:12:38,149
I will fight you with all the
strength I have at my command.

180
00:12:39,100 --> 00:12:40,120
Come with me.

181
00:12:40,460 --> 00:12:42,260
That is where we shall fight.

182
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:46,160
The Temple at Pies Bernina.

183
00:12:47,340 --> 00:12:52,200
Champions of battle would come here to
drink the blood of those they had felled,

184
00:12:52,340 --> 00:12:53,399
mixed with liquor.

185
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:56,240
They thanked the gods
for the gift of life.

186
00:12:57,520 --> 00:13:01,720
It's not an arena, but it
will serve for our fight.

187
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:06,517
Coach Lisa Lisa, you may be extremely
skilled, but you are still a woman.

188
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,717
He doesn't look as strong as Wamu was.

189
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,212
Let me take him for you.

190
00:13:10,340 --> 00:13:11,540
I will not.

191
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:16,917
I didn't live my life
as I did and train all

192
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:20,800
those years to be replaced by
some stripling. Oh, that's right.

193
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:22,765
You have lived a lot of years.

194
00:13:24,360 --> 00:13:27,380
I shall use my brilliant bone blades.

195
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:32,468
It would offend Wamu's memory if I didn't
offer you the weapon of your choice.

196
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:34,818
Feel free to pick anything you like.

197
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:38,420
My scarf will be more than sufficient.

198
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:39,900
As you will.

199
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:42,240
And now, let's fight.

200
00:13:47,580 --> 00:13:48,410
Remarkable.

201
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:51,120
There is no violence in his stance.

202
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,780
How can he fight without violence?

203
00:13:55,700 --> 00:13:56,840
What's the matter?

204
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:58,199
Are you not ready?

205
00:13:58,580 --> 00:14:00,880
Apparently, the first move is mine!

206
00:14:06,260 --> 00:14:09,378
He disappeared completely
in that sudden white light.

207
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:10,560
Where'd he go?

208
00:14:11,380 --> 00:14:12,210
Cause is here.

209
00:14:12,293 --> 00:14:13,780
I can feel him.

210
00:14:13,980 --> 00:14:17,760
But he seems to be coming
from above as well as below.

211
00:14:30,740 --> 00:14:32,657
Attack of the brilliant Boneblade!

212
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:34,916
Look, in the pillar, there's a crack!

213
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:36,660
Snake Muffler!

214
00:14:37,580 --> 00:14:38,410
Huh?

215
00:14:38,700 --> 00:14:41,797
What you don't know is
this Satoporosia Beetle

216
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:44,960
Scarf is able to conduct
hormone energy perfectly.

217
00:14:45,300 --> 00:14:48,340
It's both a deadly weapon
and a life detector.

218
00:14:48,700 --> 00:14:51,700
And it protects against
being attacked from behind!

219
00:14:58,740 --> 00:15:00,397
All right, a knockout!

220
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,900
My wonderful coach really got him good.

221
00:15:03,180 --> 00:15:07,320
He didn't really compare to Wamuu,
but dogs who bark rarely bite.

222
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:11,174
Coach, I have to say that you
really are better than me.

223
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:16,020
Help me!

224
00:15:16,220 --> 00:15:17,360
Help me, Lord Kars!

225
00:15:18,320 --> 00:15:19,920
Oh, Kars is behind her!

226
00:15:20,540 --> 00:15:21,700
Then who's that?

227
00:15:21,900 --> 00:15:22,959
Who's at her feet?

228
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,020
It can't be!

229
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:27,580
What the hell is going on?

230
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:31,480
Kaz wasn't the one fighting
with her, he used a double!

231
00:15:34,620 --> 00:15:36,280
Hmph, what stupidity.

232
00:15:36,560 --> 00:15:39,300
Why would I ever choose
to fight one-on-one?

233
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:42,757
The only thing I wanted out
of this was the Red Stone,

234
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:45,840
because I planned to become
the ultimate life form.

235
00:15:46,060 --> 00:15:50,600
I am not a warrior philosopher like
Wamuu was, nor am I a romantic.

236
00:15:51,620 --> 00:15:54,380
No matter the method
utilized, in the end...

237
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:58,060
Victory is the only thing that matters!

238
00:16:00,740 --> 00:16:03,840
So, that's why I sensed no violence.

239
00:16:04,380 --> 00:16:07,300
He never had any intention of fighting me.

240
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,300
It's over!

241
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,720
Joe... Joe...

242
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:16,760
I have the red stone.

243
00:16:17,180 --> 00:16:22,140
The only thing that's left is for all
of you to make me happy by killing Jojo!

244
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:28,640
CAUSE! CAUSE!

245
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:30,800
You are going to pay!

246
00:16:33,860 --> 00:16:34,690
CAUSE!

247
00:16:35,420 --> 00:16:37,440
Out of the way! Move back!

248
00:16:37,640 --> 00:16:40,052
Customers took down stealth and kill you!

249
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:41,440
Zoom punch!

250
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,740
You're homo!

251
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:50,019
I don't think it's working anymore!

252
00:16:50,160 --> 00:16:53,620
You're weak now, so
we're - Remove overdrive!

253
00:16:58,980 --> 00:17:01,460
Jojo, you look completely worn out.

254
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:03,680
Your breathing is ragged.

255
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,620
Your Hamon level is weak.

256
00:17:06,260 --> 00:17:11,480
And you're the only one left out of all
of the Hamon users that Lisa Lisa trained.

257
00:17:11,980 --> 00:17:13,200
Can you last?

258
00:17:13,420 --> 00:17:14,620
Will you last?

259
00:17:16,240 --> 00:17:19,377
Jojo, think you can beat me?

260
00:17:19,460 --> 00:17:20,880
He-he-he, hmmm.

261
00:17:24,980 --> 00:17:25,810
What?

262
00:17:26,020 --> 00:17:27,480
It can't be gone!

263
00:17:27,660 --> 00:17:29,360
Let's rip off his skin!

264
00:17:29,940 --> 00:17:31,560
Oh, crap! You can try!

265
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:41,760
That light!

266
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,540
And that face!

267
00:17:45,960 --> 00:17:47,757
This is your warning, Vampires!

268
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:51,880
You are now facing Major von
Stroheim, unser German elite!

269
00:17:52,380 --> 00:17:58,320
And we represent the special forces of
the Speedwagon Foundation! Jojo! Jojo!

270
00:17:58,940 --> 00:17:59,770
Da!

271
00:17:59,853 --> 00:18:01,228
Speedwagon, you look great!

272
00:18:01,360 --> 00:18:02,420
And Smokey, too!

273
00:18:02,660 --> 00:18:04,440
You're a sight for sore eyes!

274
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:12,340
My right leg might be stiff now, but my
body is better than it ever was before!

275
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:16,760
Now all your vampires will see
what German science can do!

276
00:18:17,840 --> 00:18:20,820
HE'S A ULTRA VIOLENT BLOODLINE!

277
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:26,478
It was the Speedwagon Foundation
that made them small enough to carry.

278
00:18:26,780 --> 00:18:28,800
But our boy does like to brag.

279
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:35,670
Hm...

280
00:18:35,753 --> 00:18:37,760
Crafty creatures, no question.

281
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:39,670
Hm?

282
00:18:40,840 --> 00:18:42,477
I don't see Jojo down there.

283
00:18:42,560 --> 00:18:43,600
Gone again!

284
00:18:45,540 --> 00:18:50,977
oh you're just as quick as ever aren't
you take eyes off you for a second

285
00:18:51,060 --> 00:18:57,857
and there you are putting another
little scheme in play you crossed a line

286
00:18:57,940 --> 00:19:03,677
no honor earns you no consideration
you said it would be a fair fight but

287
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:08,740
attacked Lisa Lisa in a cowardly ambush
thereby showing what you're made of.

288
00:19:09,340 --> 00:19:13,105
And you have betrayed the honor
and memory of your friend, Wamu.

289
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:14,840
Save your indignation.

290
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:16,780
Your outrage means nothing.

291
00:19:17,220 --> 00:19:20,340
Any action is a means to
an end for what I desire.

292
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:23,500
The thing that matters
to me is the Red Stone.

293
00:19:24,140 --> 00:19:29,277
Battling over thousands of years means
minimizing danger, not taking any risk?

294
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:31,948
and moving your pawns
very carefully indeed.

295
00:19:32,580 --> 00:19:34,874
This is what the battle has been about.

296
00:19:35,120 --> 00:19:37,700
And to show you how good I am at this,

297
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:41,900
I'm going to maneuver you effortlessly
to your death. Listen to me!

298
00:19:42,120 --> 00:19:44,100
For your information, Kars!

299
00:19:44,260 --> 00:19:47,720
I've never hated anyone before
this day, but you I hate!

300
00:19:48,020 --> 00:19:49,420
You really hate me?

301
00:19:49,820 --> 00:19:51,480
Then show me, Jojo.

302
00:19:51,900 --> 00:19:53,240
Let's go one-on-one.

303
00:19:53,540 --> 00:19:56,246
We'll have that fair
fight you wanted to have.

304
00:19:59,700 --> 00:20:01,660
Lisa Lisa is almost dead.

305
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,760
But not completely yet.

306
00:20:04,020 --> 00:20:05,340
I left her alive.

307
00:20:05,580 --> 00:20:07,817
My plan is to let her live for a while.

308
00:20:07,900 --> 00:20:12,617
And why would I do that
she's just another pawn

309
00:20:12,700 --> 00:20:16,860
a worthless little pawn
I Can use against you?

310
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:29,300
You utter bastard!

311
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Now I've tied her feet
together with this rope.

312
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,540
And do you know why?

313
00:20:38,120 --> 00:20:40,600
Why would I do such a thing as this?

314
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:43,020
This is why!

315
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:45,317
Lisa Lisa, no!

316
00:20:45,400 --> 00:20:46,520
Off you go!

317
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:49,580
If she hits the ground, she'll be dead.

318
00:20:50,240 --> 00:20:55,800
If you don't save her in a few seconds,
she'll be a Lisa-Lisa-shaped splatter!

319
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:04,160
What? Jojo!

320
00:21:04,460 --> 00:21:06,900
Lisa-Lisa! Huh? Lisa-Lisa?

321
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:08,460
That Lisa-Lisa?

322
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:11,000
Do you mean to say she's the baby?

323
00:21:11,300 --> 00:21:13,594
On the ship Granny Arena told us about?

324
00:21:16,060 --> 00:21:19,460
Then that means she is JoJo's...

325
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:26,500
Now that you can't move from that spot,
here's how efficient battle can be, JoJo!

326
00:21:27,180 --> 00:21:33,080
I'll very calmly walk right up to you and
slice you to pieces while you can't move!

327
00:21:40,420 --> 00:21:41,900
Cars, you bastard!

328
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:44,833
There's a place waiting for you in hell!

329
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:47,000
Jojo doesn't know.

330
00:21:47,320 --> 00:21:51,360
He doesn't know the woman he's
trying to save is his mother.

331
00:22:05,580 --> 00:22:08,640
I'll be the roundabout.

332
00:22:09,060 --> 00:22:12,697
The words will make you out and out.

333
00:22:12,780 --> 00:22:16,660
I'll spend the day your way.

334
00:22:17,860 --> 00:22:20,817
Call it morning, driving through the sun.

335
00:22:20,900 --> 00:22:22,500
And in and out the valley.

336
00:22:32,300 --> 00:22:35,597
The music dance and sing.

337
00:22:35,680 --> 00:22:39,757
They make the children really ring.

338
00:22:39,840 --> 00:22:43,840
I'll spend the day your way.

339
00:22:45,360 --> 00:22:47,937
Cold in morning, driving through the sun.

340
00:22:48,020 --> 00:22:49,760
And in and out the valley.

341
00:22:51,840 --> 00:22:54,380
In and out around the lake.

342
00:22:55,600 --> 00:22:57,777
Mountains come out of the sky.

343
00:22:57,860 --> 00:22:59,520
And they'll stand there.

344
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:04,757
One mile over, we'll be there.

345
00:23:04,840 --> 00:23:06,220
And we'll see you.

346
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:11,257
Ten, two summers, we'll be there.

347
00:23:11,340 --> 00:23:12,740
Locking with you.

348
00:23:16,120 --> 00:23:18,317
Twenty, four, five, five, let me see.

349
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:21,160
I'll be there with you.

350
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:30,777
Have you finished disposing
of those vampires yet?

351
00:23:30,860 --> 00:23:33,177
I'm taking your life at
the moment of my choice.

352
00:23:33,260 --> 00:23:34,717
The scarf is a gamble.

353
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:35,837
Poor little child.

354
00:23:35,920 --> 00:23:37,700
Von Stroheim, you must stop!

355
00:23:37,820 --> 00:23:38,680
This can't be!
